# Third-party text, kept locally and never committed. The card strategy guides are scraped and
# synthesised from twilightstrategy.com (Chirag Asnani) and quote the cards' own flavour text,
# which is GMT Games copyright -- neither is ours to redistribute under this repository's MIT
# licence. tools/scrape_card_strategies.py regenerates them locally.
docs/card_strategies.md
docs/strategy/

# Official rulebook PDF is copyrighted material (GMT Games) -- not ours to redistribute.
# Everything else in rules/ (cards.json, map.json, rules.json/.md, flags.json, etc.) is this
# project's own derived data/spec and is committed.
rules/Rules_Final.pdf

